  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上一集我们算了王成书三回，我愿意的账，四十六岁清零，四十九岁消失，把余生也交出去。很多女性观众看完留言说，太不容易了，一个女人在全是男人的领域里得扛多少压力。今天这集我们就专门讲讲这个，我先问你个问题，中国第一颗原子弹团队里有没有女科学家？大量大部分人摇头，再问邓稼先、钱学森、于敏这些名字后头有没有一个女人有。而且在核燃料浓缩这个最关键的环节只有一位当年在甘肃兰州的武陵寺厂，中国第一座浓缩油工厂。那么多科研人员里，她是唯一的女性，把镜头拉远到整个中国的核武研制核心队伍，他也是极少数的女科学家之一。西方媒体给他起了个外号中国的居里夫人，可居里夫人拿了两座诺贝尔奖，名字刻遍全世界。这位中国的居里夫人名字被他自己亲手藏了三十年。藏到离世的那天，全国没几个人知道他是谁。他叫王成书，今天这集讲讲这个用一辈子把谁说女子不如男的话烙印在骨子里的女人。一九一二年，他生在上海一个诗书，人家名字取自尚书，家里四个姐妹，他排第二。小时候家里凡是跟数字沾边的活，全归他这姑娘的数学回回考第一。一九三零年十八岁，他考进燕京大学物理系。那届物理系只录取了十三个新生，其中女生就她一根独苗。那个年代的风言风语，你闭着眼都能想到女孩子家读什么物理公式和仪器，那是女人玩的吗？王成书一句，不辩解，他的回应方式就一个字，考大一第一，大二、第一、大三还是第一。一九三四年毕业，那十三个人里能撑着拿到学位的只剩四个，他年年榜首，还领走了燕大给物理系学生的最高荣誉金钥匙奖。一九三六年拿到硕士学位留校任教，他把女生学不了理科。这句话从一九三零年考到一九三六年，考到没人敢再说，这是他第一次打脸。可燕大的天花板，只是燕大的天花板，不是他的。一九三九年，他跟物理学家张文玉结婚，一九四一年夫妻俩双双赴美，他进了密歇根大学导师，是国际物理学权威人物呼伦贝克，婚后女眷出国，那个年代有多难，你自己品，他不但出去了，还出去就炸了。一九四四年拿到博士学位。一九五一年，他跟导师把气体分子运动论理一道，横贯国际学界的难题，解开了方程，直接以两人姓氏命名。王成书乌伦贝克方程，简称WCU方程，一经发表轰动世界物理学界，至今还是这个领域的经典工具。他顺手还干了件事儿，把查普曼考林那本权威教科书非均匀气体的数学理论里的系数错误，当众纠正了过来。西方学术界炸了锅，搞出这一切的居然是个中国人，而且还是个女人，这颠覆了他们对中国人对女人的一切想象。导石乌伦贝克断言，这是不可多得的人才，留在美国诺贝尔奖只是时间问题，这是他第二次打脸。在西方人自己的主场，把诺奖级成果一个接一个掏出来。一个女人在美国人自己的地盘上要名有名，要利有利。普林斯顿高级研究所两度向他敞开大门，然后他不要了。一九四九年，新中国成立，她跟丈夫第二天就把回国俩字焊在了心口上。美国不许走朝鲜战争，一开打，直接下禁令监视传讯扣，人一扣就是整整七年。他把家产送人，把资料分成三百多个邮包，蚂蚁搬家一样寄回祖国一九五六年十月。终于他们回到祖国回来之后，老天爷给他安排了第三次考验，专门试一个女人，把国家看得有多重。一九五八年，钱三强请他转行搞热核巨变，国内这方面还是一片空白。四十六岁的他专业已经定型，说作废就作废。他说我愿意后来用了两年自学俄语，在火车上七天七夜，翻译俄语的学武德方案，直接成了中国热核巨变研究的开创者。一九六一年苏联专家全部卷图纸跑光何然料浓缩有卡脖子钱三强把话给他挑明了，要绝对保密，不能发论文，不能开会去向，连丈夫都不能讲。王成书这个人等于从世界上抹除。嗯，他说我愿意。一九六二年，他悄悄去了兰州武林市场，丈夫在外承担任务，儿子独自住校，一家三口天各一方，全场那么多科研人员，就他一个女的，你能想象那个画面吗？大西北戈壁滩边上的工厂全是男的，就一个清瘦的女人，每天后半夜去抢计算机，手摇计算机算到手指发麻，几十箱计算纸条堆的比人高，他一头黑发就这么一根一根白了。有一次领导来视察，问他能不能按时完成任务，他看着对方说了一句，让在场所有人都红了眼的话。在我的字典里，除了对孩子的承诺没有兑现对国家的要求，我全能兑现，他对得起四万万孩子，唯独对不起自己。家那一个。一九六四年一月十四日，第一批风度百分之九十以上的合格核燃料下线，中国成为世界第五个掌握这项技术的国家。十月十六日，罗布泊内一声巨响，蘑菇云直接升腾。聂荣臻把他的名字报给毛主席。毛主席说，这是中国第一颗原子弹爆炸的女功臣，举国沸腾。那天欢庆的人群里没有他，因为他早就接了。第三个任需要继续隐姓埋名，这是他第三次打脸，用消失三十年告诉所有人，女人扛得起国家的使命。他这一辈子十八岁，用考分打脸，女生读不了理科。三十九岁，用方程打脸中国人搞不了物理，四十九岁用消失三十年打脸女人扛不起国家的使命。西方叫他中国的居里夫人，他摆摆手，不要，他，只要国家需要时，那三个字说得出口，下一集。王成书系列大结局，一九九四年，他走了，留下三份遗嘱遗体手稿全部存款，一样不剩，全给了国家。他把名字还给了时代，把遗体还给了医学研究，把积蓄还给了孩子，唯独没给自己留一点私心，点个红心收藏这条视频，转发出去，关注我，大结局见。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 2670,
      "text": "上一集我们算了王成书三回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2690,
      "end_ms": 3630,
      "text": "我愿意的账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4150,
      "end_ms": 5550,
      "text": "四十六岁清零，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6010,
      "end_ms": 7410,
      "text": "四十九岁消失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8130,
      "end_ms": 9730,
      "text": "把余生也交出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10410,
      "end_ms": 12850,
      "text": "很多女性观众看完留言说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13170,
      "end_ms": 14230,
      "text": "太不容易了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14790,
      "end_ms": 19670,
      "text": "一个女人在全是男人的领域里得扛多少压力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20130,
      "end_ms": 23030,
      "text": "今天这集我们就专门讲讲这个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23570,
      "end_ms": 24690,
      "text": "我先问你个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25010,
      "end_ms": 29550,
      "text": "中国第一颗原子弹团队里有没有女科学家？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29690,
      "end_ms": 30940,
      "text": "大量大部分人摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31440,
      "end_ms": 39570,
      "text": "再问邓稼先、钱学森、于敏这些名字后头有没有一个女人有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00014",
      "start_ms": 40790,
      "end_ms": 49690,
      "text": "而且在核燃料浓缩这个最关键的环节只有一位当年在甘肃兰州的武陵寺厂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00015",
      "start_ms": 50430,
      "end_ms": 53390,
      "text": "中国第一座浓缩油工厂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00016",
      "start_ms": 53910,
      "end_ms": 55490,
      "text": "那么多科研人员里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00017",
      "start_ms": 55590,
      "end_ms": 56910,
      "text": "她是唯一的女性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00018",
      "start_ms": 57350,
      "end_ms": 62705,
      "text": "把镜头拉远到整个中国的核武研制核心队伍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00019",
      "start_ms": 63190,
      "end_ms": 66115,
      "text": "他也是极少数的女科学家之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00020",
      "start_ms": 66660,
      "end_ms": 70265,
      "text": "西方媒体给他起了个外号中国的居里夫人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00021",
      "start_ms": 70620,
      "end_ms": 73545,
      "text": "可居里夫人拿了两座诺贝尔奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00022",
      "start_ms": 73930,
      "end_ms": 75385,
      "text": "名字刻遍全世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00023",
      "start_ms": 75650,
      "end_ms": 79895,
      "text": "这位中国的居里夫人名字被他自己亲手藏了三十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00024",
      "start_ms": 80400,
      "end_ms": 81735,
      "text": "藏到离世的那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00025",
      "start_ms": 82150,
      "end_ms": 84085,
      "text": "全国没几个人知道他是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00026",
      "start_ms": 84570,
      "end_ms": 85585,
      "text": "他叫王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00027",
      "start_ms": 86660,
      "end_ms": 94065,
      "text": "今天这集讲讲这个用一辈子把谁说女子不如男的话烙印在骨子里的女人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00028",
      "start_ms": 95250,
      "end_ms": 96155,
      "text": "一九一二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00029",
      "start_ms": 96460,
      "end_ms": 97980,
      "text": "他生在上海一个诗书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00030",
      "start_ms": 97980,
      "end_ms": 100825,
      "text": "人家名字取自尚书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00031",
      "start_ms": 101370,
      "end_ms": 102585,
      "text": "家里四个姐妹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00032",
      "start_ms": 102900,
      "end_ms": 103585,
      "text": "他排第二。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00033",
      "start_ms": 104500,
      "end_ms": 108155,
      "text": "小时候家里凡是跟数字沾边的活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00034",
      "start_ms": 108610,
      "end_ms": 112035,
      "text": "全归他这姑娘的数学回回考第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00035",
      "start_ms": 112490,
      "end_ms": 114265,
      "text": "一九三零年十八岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00036",
      "start_ms": 114610,
      "end_ms": 116825,
      "text": "他考进燕京大学物理系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00037",
      "start_ms": 117520,
      "end_ms": 120155,
      "text": "那届物理系只录取了十三个新生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00038",
      "start_ms": 120940,
      "end_ms": 122905,
      "text": "其中女生就她一根独苗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00039",
      "start_ms": 123460,
      "end_ms": 125305,
      "text": "那个年代的风言风语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00040",
      "start_ms": 125770,
      "end_ms": 132475,
      "text": "你闭着眼都能想到女孩子家读什么物理公式和仪器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00041",
      "start_ms": 132760,
      "end_ms": 133965,
      "text": "那是女人玩的吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00042",
      "start_ms": 135250,
      "end_ms": 136350,
      "text": "王成书一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00043",
      "start_ms": 136370,
      "end_ms": 137045,
      "text": "不辩解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00044",
      "start_ms": 138070,
      "end_ms": 139775,
      "text": "他的回应方式就一个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00045",
      "start_ms": 140360,
      "end_ms": 141400,
      "text": "考大一第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00046",
      "start_ms": 141400,
      "end_ms": 143315,
      "text": "大二、第一、大三还是第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00047",
      "start_ms": 144160,
      "end_ms": 145785,
      "text": "一九三四年毕业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00048",
      "start_ms": 146270,
      "end_ms": 150390,
      "text": "那十三个人里能撑着拿到学位的只剩四个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00049",
      "start_ms": 150390,
      "end_ms": 151485,
      "text": "他年年榜首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00050",
      "start_ms": 151830,
      "end_ms": 156795,
      "text": "还领走了燕大给物理系学生的最高荣誉金钥匙奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00051",
      "start_ms": 157840,
      "end_ms": 161615,
      "text": "一九三六年拿到硕士学位留校任教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00052",
      "start_ms": 162340,
      "end_ms": 163880,
      "text": "他把女生学不了理科。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00053",
      "start_ms": 163880,
      "end_ms": 167015,
      "text": "这句话从一九三零年考到一九三六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00054",
      "start_ms": 167810,
      "end_ms": 169335,
      "text": "考到没人敢再说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00055",
      "start_ms": 170150,
      "end_ms": 171515,
      "text": "这是他第一次打脸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00056",
      "start_ms": 172700,
      "end_ms": 174135,
      "text": "可燕大的天花板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00057",
      "start_ms": 174970,
      "end_ms": 176735,
      "text": "只是燕大的天花板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00058",
      "start_ms": 178340,
      "end_ms": 179095,
      "text": "不是他的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00059",
      "start_ms": 179590,
      "end_ms": 180765,
      "text": "一九三九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00060",
      "start_ms": 181110,
      "end_ms": 183155,
      "text": "他跟物理学家张文玉结婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00061",
      "start_ms": 183790,
      "end_ms": 186510,
      "text": "一九四一年夫妻俩双双赴美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00062",
      "start_ms": 186510,
      "end_ms": 189250,
      "text": "他进了密歇根大学导师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00063",
      "start_ms": 189310,
      "end_ms": 192755,
      "text": "是国际物理学权威人物呼伦贝克，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00064",
      "start_ms": 193130,
      "end_ms": 194745,
      "text": "婚后女眷出国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00065",
      "start_ms": 195460,
      "end_ms": 196760,
      "text": "那个年代有多难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00066",
      "start_ms": 196980,
      "end_ms": 197785,
      "text": "你自己品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00067",
      "start_ms": 198260,
      "end_ms": 199255,
      "text": "他不但出去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00068",
      "start_ms": 199750,
      "end_ms": 200855,
      "text": "还出去就炸了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00069",
      "start_ms": 202220,
      "end_ms": 204355,
      "text": "一九四四年拿到博士学位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00070",
      "start_ms": 205230,
      "end_ms": 206195,
      "text": "一九五一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00071",
      "start_ms": 206570,
      "end_ms": 209860,
      "text": "他跟导师把气体分子运动论理一道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00072",
      "start_ms": 209880,
      "end_ms": 212040,
      "text": "横贯国际学界的难题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00073",
      "start_ms": 212180,
      "end_ms": 213890,
      "text": "解开了方程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00074",
      "start_ms": 213890,
      "end_ms": 216575,
      "text": "直接以两人姓氏命名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00075",
      "start_ms": 216930,
      "end_ms": 219325,
      "text": "王成书乌伦贝克方程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00076",
      "start_ms": 219940,
      "end_ms": 221795,
      "text": "简称WCU方程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00077",
      "start_ms": 222270,
      "end_ms": 225410,
      "text": "一经发表轰动世界物理学界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00078",
      "start_ms": 225430,
      "end_ms": 228405,
      "text": "至今还是这个领域的经典工具。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00079",
      "start_ms": 228920,
      "end_ms": 230595,
      "text": "他顺手还干了件事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00080",
      "start_ms": 231020,
      "end_ms": 237925,
      "text": "把查普曼考林那本权威教科书非均匀气体的数学理论里的系数错误，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00081",
      "start_ms": 238500,
      "end_ms": 240345,
      "text": "当众纠正了过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00082",
      "start_ms": 241330,
      "end_ms": 243095,
      "text": "西方学术界炸了锅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00083",
      "start_ms": 243580,
      "end_ms": 246435,
      "text": "搞出这一切的居然是个中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00084",
      "start_ms": 246920,
      "end_ms": 248305,
      "text": "而且还是个女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00085",
      "start_ms": 248870,
      "end_ms": 253175,
      "text": "这颠覆了他们对中国人对女人的一切想象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00086",
      "start_ms": 253670,
      "end_ms": 255125,
      "text": "导石乌伦贝克断言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00087",
      "start_ms": 255430,
      "end_ms": 257235,
      "text": "这是不可多得的人才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00088",
      "start_ms": 257880,
      "end_ms": 260990,
      "text": "留在美国诺贝尔奖只是时间问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00089",
      "start_ms": 261190,
      "end_ms": 262435,
      "text": "这是他第二次打脸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00090",
      "start_ms": 263030,
      "end_ms": 265025,
      "text": "在西方人自己的主场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00091",
      "start_ms": 265530,
      "end_ms": 269205,
      "text": "把诺奖级成果一个接一个掏出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00092",
      "start_ms": 270200,
      "end_ms": 275515,
      "text": "一个女人在美国人自己的地盘上要名有名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00093",
      "start_ms": 276090,
      "end_ms": 276825,
      "text": "要利有利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00094",
      "start_ms": 278080,
      "end_ms": 282045,
      "text": "普林斯顿高级研究所两度向他敞开大门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00095",
      "start_ms": 282500,
      "end_ms": 283865,
      "text": "然后他不要了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00096",
      "start_ms": 285020,
      "end_ms": 286020,
      "text": "一九四九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00097",
      "start_ms": 286020,
      "end_ms": 286935,
      "text": "新中国成立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00098",
      "start_ms": 287210,
      "end_ms": 290875,
      "text": "她跟丈夫第二天就把回国俩字焊在了心口上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00099",
      "start_ms": 291550,
      "end_ms": 293725,
      "text": "美国不许走朝鲜战争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00100",
      "start_ms": 294000,
      "end_ms": 294600,
      "text": "一开打，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00101",
      "start_ms": 294700,
      "end_ms": 297380,
      "text": "直接下禁令监视传讯扣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00102",
      "start_ms": 297380,
      "end_ms": 299735,
      "text": "人一扣就是整整七年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00103",
      "start_ms": 300220,
      "end_ms": 301660,
      "text": "他把家产送人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00104",
      "start_ms": 301900,
      "end_ms": 303960,
      "text": "把资料分成三百多个邮包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00105",
      "start_ms": 303960,
      "end_ms": 308135,
      "text": "蚂蚁搬家一样寄回祖国一九五六年十月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00106",
      "start_ms": 308450,
      "end_ms": 311270,
      "text": "终于他们回到祖国回来之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00107",
      "start_ms": 311530,
      "end_ms": 313970,
      "text": "老天爷给他安排了第三次考验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00108",
      "start_ms": 314470,
      "end_ms": 316050,
      "text": "专门试一个女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00109",
      "start_ms": 316130,
      "end_ms": 317850,
      "text": "把国家看得有多重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00110",
      "start_ms": 318790,
      "end_ms": 319830,
      "text": "一九五八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00111",
      "start_ms": 320330,
      "end_ms": 323830,
      "text": "钱三强请他转行搞热核巨变，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00112",
      "start_ms": 324330,
      "end_ms": 326290,
      "text": "国内这方面还是一片空白。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00113",
      "start_ms": 327190,
      "end_ms": 330950,
      "text": "四十六岁的他专业已经定型，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00114",
      "start_ms": 331750,
      "end_ms": 333470,
      "text": "说作废就作废。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00115",
      "start_ms": 333550,
      "end_ms": 340170,
      "text": "他说我愿意后来用了两年自学俄语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00116",
      "start_ms": 340670,
      "end_ms": 343290,
      "text": "在火车上七天七夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00117",
      "start_ms": 343650,
      "end_ms": 345930,
      "text": "翻译俄语的学武德方案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00118",
      "start_ms": 346730,
      "end_ms": 350770,
      "text": "直接成了中国热核巨变研究的开创者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00119",
      "start_ms": 351370,
      "end_ms": 360570,
      "text": "一九六一年苏联专家全部卷图纸跑光何然料浓缩有卡脖子钱三强把话给他挑明了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00120",
      "start_ms": 360850,
      "end_ms": 361890,
      "text": "要绝对保密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00121",
      "start_ms": 362070,
      "end_ms": 362970,
      "text": "不能发论文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00122",
      "start_ms": 363090,
      "end_ms": 364950,
      "text": "不能开会去向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00123",
      "start_ms": 364990,
      "end_ms": 366355,
      "text": "连丈夫都不能讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00124",
      "start_ms": 367020,
      "end_ms": 370015,
      "text": "王成书这个人等于从世界上抹除。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00125",
      "start_ms": 370130,
      "end_ms": 370295,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00126",
      "start_ms": 370750,
      "end_ms": 372065,
      "text": "他说我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00127",
      "start_ms": 372330,
      "end_ms": 373235,
      "text": "一九六二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00128",
      "start_ms": 373620,
      "end_ms": 376055,
      "text": "他悄悄去了兰州武林市场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00129",
      "start_ms": 376450,
      "end_ms": 377995,
      "text": "丈夫在外承担任务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00130",
      "start_ms": 378450,
      "end_ms": 379815,
      "text": "儿子独自住校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00131",
      "start_ms": 380210,
      "end_ms": 381875,
      "text": "一家三口天各一方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00132",
      "start_ms": 382810,
      "end_ms": 384685,
      "text": "全场那么多科研人员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00133",
      "start_ms": 385190,
      "end_ms": 386105,
      "text": "就他一个女的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00134",
      "start_ms": 387400,
      "end_ms": 388995,
      "text": "你能想象那个画面吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00135",
      "start_ms": 389980,
      "end_ms": 395025,
      "text": "大西北戈壁滩边上的工厂全是男的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00136",
      "start_ms": 395970,
      "end_ms": 397645,
      "text": "就一个清瘦的女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00137",
      "start_ms": 398690,
      "end_ms": 400865,
      "text": "每天后半夜去抢计算机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00138",
      "start_ms": 401320,
      "end_ms": 403775,
      "text": "手摇计算机算到手指发麻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00139",
      "start_ms": 404330,
      "end_ms": 407285,
      "text": "几十箱计算纸条堆的比人高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00140",
      "start_ms": 407860,
      "end_ms": 411515,
      "text": "他一头黑发就这么一根一根白了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00141",
      "start_ms": 411710,
      "end_ms": 413490,
      "text": "有一次领导来视察，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00142",
      "start_ms": 413770,
      "end_ms": 415845,
      "text": "问他能不能按时完成任务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00143",
      "start_ms": 416690,
      "end_ms": 418390,
      "text": "他看着对方说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00144",
      "start_ms": 418390,
      "end_ms": 420615,
      "text": "让在场所有人都红了眼的话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00145",
      "start_ms": 421490,
      "end_ms": 422545,
      "text": "在我的字典里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00146",
      "start_ms": 422850,
      "end_ms": 427075,
      "text": "除了对孩子的承诺没有兑现对国家的要求，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00147",
      "start_ms": 427580,
      "end_ms": 428645,
      "text": "我全能兑现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00148",
      "start_ms": 429200,
      "end_ms": 430965,
      "text": "他对得起四万万孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00149",
      "start_ms": 431400,
      "end_ms": 432720,
      "text": "唯独对不起自己。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00150",
      "start_ms": 432720,
      "end_ms": 433565,
      "text": "家那一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00151",
      "start_ms": 434220,
      "end_ms": 436185,
      "text": "一九六四年一月十四日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00152",
      "start_ms": 436540,
      "end_ms": 441225,
      "text": "第一批风度百分之九十以上的合格核燃料下线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00153",
      "start_ms": 441910,
      "end_ms": 445810,
      "text": "中国成为世界第五个掌握这项技术的国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00154",
      "start_ms": 446030,
      "end_ms": 447045,
      "text": "十月十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00155",
      "start_ms": 447660,
      "end_ms": 449555,
      "text": "罗布泊内一声巨响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00156",
      "start_ms": 450020,
      "end_ms": 451775,
      "text": "蘑菇云直接升腾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00157",
      "start_ms": 452340,
      "end_ms": 454655,
      "text": "聂荣臻把他的名字报给毛主席。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00158",
      "start_ms": 455190,
      "end_ms": 455985,
      "text": "毛主席说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00159",
      "start_ms": 456370,
      "end_ms": 460265,
      "text": "这是中国第一颗原子弹爆炸的女功臣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00160",
      "start_ms": 460920,
      "end_ms": 461740,
      "text": "举国沸腾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00161",
      "start_ms": 461740,
      "end_ms": 464505,
      "text": "那天欢庆的人群里没有他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00162",
      "start_ms": 464950,
      "end_ms": 466150,
      "text": "因为他早就接了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00163",
      "start_ms": 466150,
      "end_ms": 469355,
      "text": "第三个任需要继续隐姓埋名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00164",
      "start_ms": 470290,
      "end_ms": 471805,
      "text": "这是他第三次打脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00165",
      "start_ms": 472690,
      "end_ms": 475955,
      "text": "用消失三十年告诉所有人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00166",
      "start_ms": 476340,
      "end_ms": 478545,
      "text": "女人扛得起国家的使命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00167",
      "start_ms": 479090,
      "end_ms": 481055,
      "text": "他这一辈子十八岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00168",
      "start_ms": 481380,
      "end_ms": 482555,
      "text": "用考分打脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00169",
      "start_ms": 482900,
      "end_ms": 484280,
      "text": "女生读不了理科。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00170",
      "start_ms": 484400,
      "end_ms": 485220,
      "text": "三十九岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00171",
      "start_ms": 485240,
      "end_ms": 488295,
      "text": "用方程打脸中国人搞不了物理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00172",
      "start_ms": 488730,
      "end_ms": 493705,
      "text": "四十九岁用消失三十年打脸女人扛不起国家的使命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00173",
      "start_ms": 494240,
      "end_ms": 496655,
      "text": "西方叫他中国的居里夫人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00174",
      "start_ms": 497240,
      "end_ms": 497960,
      "text": "他摆摆手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00175",
      "start_ms": 497980,
      "end_ms": 498385,
      "text": "不要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00176",
      "start_ms": 498730,
      "end_ms": 498930,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00177",
      "start_ms": 498930,
      "end_ms": 500465,
      "text": "只要国家需要时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00178",
      "start_ms": 500830,
      "end_ms": 502485,
      "text": "那三个字说得出口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00179",
      "start_ms": 503550,
      "end_ms": 504230,
      "text": "下一集。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00180",
      "start_ms": 504430,
      "end_ms": 506235,
      "text": "王成书系列大结局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00181",
      "start_ms": 507020,
      "end_ms": 508120,
      "text": "一九九四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00182",
      "start_ms": 508120,
      "end_ms": 508875,
      "text": "他走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00183",
      "start_ms": 509300,
      "end_ms": 514050,
      "text": "留下三份遗嘱遗体手稿全部存款，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00184",
      "start_ms": 514210,
      "end_ms": 514925,
      "text": "一样不剩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00185",
      "start_ms": 515270,
      "end_ms": 516235,
      "text": "全给了国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00186",
      "start_ms": 516700,
      "end_ms": 518320,
      "text": "他把名字还给了时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00187",
      "start_ms": 518440,
      "end_ms": 520320,
      "text": "把遗体还给了医学研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00188",
      "start_ms": 520340,
      "end_ms": 522595,
      "text": "把积蓄还给了孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00189",
      "start_ms": 522930,
      "end_ms": 525605,
      "text": "唯独没给自己留一点私心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00190",
      "start_ms": 525910,
      "end_ms": 528445,
      "text": "点个红心收藏这条视频，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00191",
      "start_ms": 528800,
      "end_ms": 529655,
      "text": "转发出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00192",
      "start_ms": 530520,
      "end_ms": 531165,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d0c04a2af8ad5223_s00193",
      "start_ms": 531380,
      "end_ms": 531945,
      "text": "大结局见。"
    }
  ],
